// SOUNDNESS QUEUE — `admits`. Illegal Rust (upstream E0621: explicit lifetime
// required in the type of `y`), compiled clean by logosc.
//
// THE DEREF PROJECTION of `lifereg.B`. The FIELD projection of exactly this
// defect was closed 2026-09-11e by the per-place-path `params` record
