// SDerefWrite with ptr.kind() == VarRef, which reaches NEITHER the
// AddrOfTemp branch that carries the field/tuple deposit NOR the
// `index_mut` receiver-store door — borrow_check.cpp says so in its own
// words at the deref-write arm ("the plainest deref write in the language
